%% Multi-LLM trading committee (PAPER account only).
flowchart LR
    DATA[Market data, news, macro] --> PRE[Emergency trim: runs before any model]
    PRE --> C1[Model A]
    PRE --> C2[Model B]
    PRE --> C3[Model C]
    C1 --> MAJ{2-of-3 majority on direction}
    C2 --> MAJ
    C3 --> MAJ
    MAJ -->|no majority| HOLD[No trade]
    MAJ --> ARB[Arbiter: veto-only from a whitelist, cannot flip direction]
    ARB -->|veto| HOLD
    ARB --> RM[Risk Marshal: pure Python, no LLM, no appeals]
    RM -->|position, sector, correlation, drawdown, volatility limits| V{RiskVerdict}
    V -->|violation| HOLD
    V -->|ok| BR[Broker - PAPER account]
    BR --> AU[(Per-decision audit snapshot)]
    HOLD --> AU
